---
import SectionHeader from './SectionHeader.astro';
import { MessageSquareCode, ShieldCheck, Terminal, Compass, Check, X } from 'lucide-react';
---

<section id="voice" class="space-y-5 scroll-mt-24">
  <SectionHeader
    title="Voice & Tone Guidelines"
    subtitle="How Broadsage communicates across developer documentation, CLI tooling, PRs, and release notes"
    badge="Communication Standards"
  />

  {/* Core Voice Persona Banner */}
  <div class="glass-panel theme-banner-gradient p-4 sm:p-5 rounded-xl border border-amber-500/25 flex flex-col md:flex-row items-start md:items-center justify-between gap-4">
    <div class="space-y-1.5 max-w-3xl">
      <div class="flex items-center gap-2 text-amber-500 dark:text-amber-400 text-xs font-mono font-bold tracking-wider uppercase">
        <Compass className="w-3.5 h-3.5" />
        Core Persona &amp; Guiding Standard
      </div>
      <h3 class="text-base sm:text-lg font-bold dark:text-white text-navy-900 leading-snug">
        “Speak like a calm principal platform engineer: authoritative, direct, open-source first, and free of corporate hype.”
      </h3>
      <p class="text-xs dark:text-slate-300 text-slate-700 leading-relaxed">
        Broadsage treats developers as peers. We respect cognitive load, lead with technical truth, and provide calm guidance in both documentation and runtime errors.
      </p>
    </div>
    <div class="flex-shrink-0 px-3.5 py-2 rounded-lg dark:bg-slate-800/80 bg-white border dark:border-slate-700 border-ivory-400 text-center shadow-xs">
      <span class="text-[9px] font-mono uppercase text-slate-400 block">Philosophy</span>
      <span class="text-xs font-bold text-amber-500 dark:text-amber-400">Zero Fluff • Code First</span>
    </div>
  </div>

  {/* 4 Pillars of Broadsage Voice */}
  <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-3 sm:gap-4">
    {/* Pillar 1 */}
    <div class="glass-panel p-3.5 sm:p-4 rounded-xl border dark:border-slate-800 border-ivory-border hover:border-amber-500/40 transition-all space-y-2">
      <div class="w-8 h-8 rounded-lg bg-amber-500/10 border border-amber-500/30 flex items-center justify-center text-amber-500 dark:text-amber-400">
        <MessageSquareCode className="w-4 h-4" />
      </div>
      <h4 class="text-xs sm:text-sm font-bold dark:text-white text-navy-900">1. Direct &amp; Code-First</h4>
      <p class="text-xs dark:text-slate-400 text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">
        Lead with architecture, command flags, and code snippets before explanations. Never bury the solution behind conversational fluff.
      </p>
    </div>

    {/* Pillar 2 */}
    <div class="glass-panel p-3.5 sm:p-4 rounded-xl border dark:border-slate-800 border-ivory-border hover:border-sky-500/40 transition-all space-y-2">
      <div class="w-8 h-8 rounded-lg bg-sky-500/10 border border-sky-500/30 flex items-center justify-center text-sky-500 dark:text-sky-400">
        <ShieldCheck className="w-4 h-4" />
      </div>
      <h4 class="text-xs sm:text-sm font-bold dark:text-white text-navy-900">2. Calm &amp; Authoritative</h4>
      <p class="text-xs dark:text-slate-400 text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">
        Sage guidance is reassuring and grounded. Frame errors as diagnostic data, not disasters. Never sound panicked, frantic, or patronizing.
      </p>
    </div>

    {/* Pillar 3 */}
    <div class="glass-panel p-3.5 sm:p-4 rounded-xl border dark:border-slate-800 border-ivory-border hover:border-emerald-500/40 transition-all space-y-2">
      <div class="w-8 h-8 rounded-lg bg-emerald-500/10 border border-emerald-500/30 flex items-center justify-center text-emerald-400">
        <Terminal className="w-4 h-4" />
      </div>
      <h4 class="text-xs sm:text-sm font-bold dark:text-white text-navy-900">3. Open-Source Sovereign</h4>
      <p class="text-xs dark:text-slate-400 text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">
        Celebrate open standards, local development freedom, and transparent code. Avoid proprietary lock-in terminology or opaque vendor claims.
      </p>
    </div>

    {/* Pillar 4 */}
    <div class="glass-panel p-3.5 sm:p-4 rounded-xl border dark:border-slate-800 border-ivory-border hover:border-purple-500/40 transition-all space-y-2">
      <div class="w-8 h-8 rounded-lg bg-purple-500/10 border border-purple-500/30 flex items-center justify-center text-purple-400">
        <Compass className="w-4 h-4" />
      </div>
      <h4 class="text-xs sm:text-sm font-bold dark:text-white text-navy-900">4. Honest About Trade-Offs</h4>
      <p class="text-xs dark:text-slate-400 text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">
        Real platform engineering involves compromises. State latency, memory overhead, and constraints openly rather than promising "magic".
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>

  {/* Real-World Voice Matrix: DO vs DON'T */}
  <div class="glass-panel rounded-xl border dark:border-slate-800 border-ivory-border overflow-hidden">
    <div class="p-3 sm:p-3.5 dark:bg-slate-900/80 bg-ivory-50 border-b dark:border-slate-800 border-ivory-border flex items-center justify-between">
      <h4 class="text-xs sm:text-sm font-bold dark:text-white text-navy-900">Developer Communication Matrix</h4>
      <span class="text-[11px] font-mono text-slate-400">Contextual Examples</span>
    </div>

    <div class="divide-y dark:divide-slate-800/80 divide-ivory-border">
      {/* Row 1: CLI & Terminal Output */}
      <div class="p-3.5 sm:p-4 grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-12 gap-3 items-start">
        <div class="md:col-span-3">
          <span class="text-xs font-mono font-bold text-amber-500 dark:text-amber-400 block">CLI &amp; Terminal</span>
          <span class="text-[10px] text-slate-400">Command completions &amp; output</span>
        </div>
        <div class="md:col-span-4 p-2.5 rounded-lg dark:bg-red-950/20 bg-red-50/80 border dark:border-red-500/20 border-red-200 text-xs dark:text-red-200 text-red-900 space-y-1">
          <div class="flex items-center gap-1.5 font-bold text-red-400 text-[10px]">
            <X className="w-3 h-3" /> AVOID (Corporate Hype)
          </div>
          <code class="block font-mono text-[10px] dark:text-red-300 text-red-800">
            "✨ Magic! Your awesome super-app is ready to fly!"
          </code>
        </div>
        <div class="md:col-span-5 p-2.5 rounded-lg dark:bg-emerald-950/20 bg-emerald-50/80 border dark:border-emerald-500/20 border-emerald-200 text-xs dark:text-emerald-200 text-emerald-900 space-y-1">
          <div class="flex items-center gap-1.5 font-bold text-emerald-400 text-[10px]">
            <Check className="w-3 h-3" /> PREFERRED (Calm &amp; Precise)
          </div>
          <code class="block font-mono text-[10px] dark:text-emerald-300 text-emerald-800">
            "✓ Platform scaffold initialized in 42ms. 3 autonomous loops ready."
          </code>
        </div>
      </div>

      {/* Row 2: Runtime Errors */}
      <div class="p-3.5 sm:p-4 grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-12 gap-3 items-start">
        <div class="md:col-span-3">
          <span class="text-xs font-mono font-bold text-amber-500 dark:text-amber-400 block">Error &amp; Failure States</span>
          <span class="text-[10px] text-slate-400">Exception logs &amp; diagnostics</span>
        </div>
        <div class="md:col-span-4 p-2.5 rounded-lg dark:bg-red-950/20 bg-red-50/80 border dark:border-red-500/20 border-red-200 text-xs dark:text-red-200 text-red-900 space-y-1">
          <div class="flex items-center gap-1.5 font-bold text-red-400 text-[10px]">
            <X className="w-3 h-3" /> AVOID (Vague &amp; Apologetic)
          </div>
          <code class="block font-mono text-[10px] dark:text-red-300 text-red-800">
            "Oopsie! Something went wrong on our end :("
          </code>
        </div>
        <div class="md:col-span-5 p-2.5 rounded-lg dark:bg-emerald-950/20 bg-emerald-50/80 border dark:border-emerald-500/20 border-emerald-200 text-xs dark:text-emerald-200 text-emerald-900 space-y-1">
          <div class="flex items-center gap-1.5 font-bold text-emerald-400 text-[10px]">
            <Check className="w-3 h-3" /> PREFERRED (Actionable Diagnostic)
          </div>
          <code class="block font-mono text-[10px] dark:text-emerald-300 text-emerald-800">
            "Error: Cluster mesh unreachable on port 8443. Check TLS cert expiration."
          </code>
        </div>
      </div>

      {/* Row 3: Product Announcements */}
      <div class="p-3.5 sm:p-4 grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-12 gap-3 items-start">
        <div class="md:col-span-3">
          <span class="text-xs font-mono font-bold text-amber-500 dark:text-amber-400 block">Release Notes &amp; PRs</span>
          <span class="text-[10px] text-slate-400">Change summaries &amp; updates</span>
        </div>
        <div class="md:col-span-4 p-2.5 rounded-lg dark:bg-red-950/20 bg-red-50/80 border dark:border-red-500/20 border-red-200 text-xs dark:text-red-200 text-red-900 space-y-1">
          <div class="flex items-center gap-1.5 font-bold text-red-400 text-[10px]">
            <X className="w-3 h-3" /> AVOID (Buzzword Inflation)
          </div>
          <p class="text-[10px] dark:text-red-300 text-red-800 leading-relaxed font-mono">
            "We leverage revolutionary paradigm shifts in hyper-scale synergistic agent automation."
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="md:col-span-5 p-2.5 rounded-lg dark:bg-emerald-950/20 bg-emerald-50/80 border dark:border-emerald-500/20 border-emerald-200 text-xs dark:text-emerald-200 text-emerald-900 space-y-1">
          <div class="flex items-center gap-1.5 font-bold text-emerald-400 text-[10px]">
            <Check className="w-3 h-3" /> PREFERRED (Substance &amp; Clarity)
          </div>
          <p class="text-[10px] dark:text-emerald-300 text-emerald-800 leading-relaxed font-mono">
            "Broadsage hardens upstream agentic AI models into deterministic, reproducible CI/CD pipelines."
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

